      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The continued advancement of multidetector computed tomography (MDCT) has launched an exciting new method for myocardial viability imaging. This article aims to present data validating MDCT for viability imaging, to demonstrate MDCT's prognostic clinical value, and to delineate its potential clinical applications."},
